WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Connect your payment provider. Configure the Starter plan with 1,000 tokens.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
A demo $29 subscription activates customer access and the token balance.

00:12.000 --> 00:19.300
Each generation uses 250 tokens. The remaining balance updates with each request.

00:19.300 --> 00:21.000
The token limit is reached. Another request is blocked without deducting tokens.

00:21.000 --> 00:28.000
An upgrade to Pro raises the allowance to 5,000 tokens. Existing usage is preserved. Creation resumes.

00:28.000 --> 00:33.000
The same embedded billing experience takes on your app name and brand colors.

00:33.000 --> 00:36.000
Switch to dark mode. Your app. Your brand. APEX underneath. All data shown is simulated.
